{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26242","headline":"金陵上李公垂侍郎 · 殷尧藩","name":"金陵上李公垂侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海国微茫散晓暾，郁葱佳气满乾坤。\n六朝空据长江险，一统今归圣代尊。\n西北诸峰连朔漠，东南衆水合崑仑。\n愿从吾道禧文运，再使河清俗化淳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷尧藩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26242.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26242","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}